1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:14,700
Your last cover was gorgeous, Yachiyo.

2
00:00:14,880 --> 00:00:16,920
Ever since she signed with that modeling group,

3
00:00:17,000 --> 00:00:18,880
Yachiyo's career's been on fire.

4
00:00:19,340 --> 00:00:20,720
Whatever happened to the others?

5
00:00:21,120 --> 00:00:21,800
Who cares?

6
00:00:22,200 --> 00:00:24,140
She's the last girl standing now.

7
00:00:24,440 --> 00:00:26,740
Hard work only takes you so far in this business.

8
00:00:26,920 --> 00:00:28,520
Without talent, you're nowhere.

9
00:00:28,520 --> 00:00:30,680
That's cool.

10
00:00:31,140 --> 00:00:32,000
I'm right, though.

11
00:00:37,040 --> 00:00:39,800
I made a wish to survive in this industry.

12
00:00:40,620 --> 00:00:43,420
That wish caused all my friends to vanish.

13
00:00:44,980 --> 00:00:46,320
I caused it.

14
00:00:46,800 --> 00:00:50,220
So I swore I'd never get close to anyone again.

15
00:00:58,520 --> 00:01:07,440
Iroha, where are you?

16
00:01:09,580 --> 00:01:10,180
Remember?

17
00:01:11,000 --> 00:01:13,260
You promised me that you'd stay with me.

18
00:01:13,260 --> 00:01:18,580
Iroha Tamaki is dead and gone like all the others.

19
00:01:19,160 --> 00:01:21,360
You're wasting your time searching for her.

20
00:01:22,120 --> 00:01:22,760
She's gone.

21
00:01:23,460 --> 00:01:23,820
Forever.

22
00:01:25,680 --> 00:01:26,580
Shut up!

23
00:01:26,580 --> 00:01:42,980
Tell me where Magia's HQ is now.

24
00:01:42,980 --> 00:01:46,980
Tell me where Magia's HQ is now.

25
00:03:17,989 --> 00:03:44,289
The Uwasa are getting stronger and stronger.

26
00:03:44,289 --> 00:03:51,289
They don't drop Graveseeds, so I can't purify my Soul Gem.

27
00:03:51,289 --> 00:04:04,289
It's getting even cloudier.

28
00:04:04,289 --> 00:04:12,289
Hotel Fent Hope, a mobile Uwasa barrier.

29
00:04:12,289 --> 00:04:33,289
You told me before how whoever stays with you ends up dying, but I'm gonna prove you're wrong about that.

30
00:04:33,289 --> 00:04:35,289
You liar!

31
00:04:35,289 --> 00:04:41,289
Liar! Liar! Liar! Liar! Liar!

32
00:04:42,289 --> 00:04:45,289
Mal...Kanai...

33
00:04:45,289 --> 00:04:59,289
I will destroy the Magius.

34
00:04:59,289 --> 00:05:13,289
The Magius will save everyone, so don't fret. We discovered a way to free all magical girls from our horrible fate.

35
00:05:13,289 --> 00:05:17,289
They can save us from being witches? That's hard to believe.

36
00:05:17,289 --> 00:05:19,289
Oh, don't be so negative. Have a little faith.

37
00:05:19,289 --> 00:05:23,289
Do you think what she's saying is possible?

38
00:05:23,289 --> 00:05:33,289
Mm-hmm. Without my doppel, I'd be a witch now. Remember?

39
00:05:33,289 --> 00:05:35,289
It's too bad!

40
00:05:35,289 --> 00:05:39,289
Heck, as long as all the witches are gone, I don't care how she does it.

41
00:05:39,289 --> 00:05:41,289
Why don't you look happy about that?

42
00:05:41,289 --> 00:05:44,289
I'm thrilled about it. It's just...

43
00:05:44,289 --> 00:05:45,289
Just what?

44
00:05:45,289 --> 00:05:48,289
I'm kind of worried about Iroha and her friends.

45
00:05:48,289 --> 00:05:52,289
Yes, they're fine. Yachiyo's with them.

46
00:05:52,289 --> 00:05:57,289
These girls have a plan, and if it really works, no one's ever gonna turn into a witch again.

47
00:05:57,289 --> 00:06:04,289
Not you, Iroha, Yachiyo, or Tsuruno. If they can save us, I'm down for whatever.

48
00:06:04,289 --> 00:06:05,289
Yeah...

49
00:06:05,289 --> 00:06:13,289
We're super excited to share the final stage of our plan with you! It'll be soon, I promise! Till then, keep up the great work!

50
00:06:13,289 --> 00:06:17,289
Remember, whether we succeed or fail depends on you!

51
00:06:23,289 --> 00:06:26,289
That speech was fantastic! Everyone loved it!

52
00:06:26,289 --> 00:06:29,289
I'll say. Your words were riveting, enchanting, inspiring!

53
00:06:29,289 --> 00:06:32,289
Yeah, I know. Is there anything to report?

54
00:06:32,289 --> 00:06:41,289
The Uwasa of Peking Castle Town, the Fireman's Mound, and Switch Street have all been defeated. And Yachiyo Nanami is the one responsible.

55
00:06:41,289 --> 00:06:43,289
Ugh, good grief. Her again?

56
00:06:43,289 --> 00:06:49,289
We know it's a huge loss for us, so we're having the other Uwasa catch more people to make up for it!

57
00:06:51,289 --> 00:06:54,289
We can't let anything or anyone get in the way! You got it?

58
00:06:54,289 --> 00:06:56,289
No! I mean yes!

59
00:06:56,289 --> 00:06:57,289
I mean yes! We got it!

60
00:06:57,289 --> 00:07:00,289
Our plan's almost ready, and we're not changing the date.

61
00:07:00,289 --> 00:07:05,289
That means, till while Pergusnacht comes, we can't afford to make any more mistakes!

62
00:07:05,289 --> 00:07:07,289
You understand that too, Mifuyu?

63
00:07:07,289 --> 00:07:10,289
Yes. I won't fail the Magias.

64
00:07:10,289 --> 00:07:39,289
Sorry. Kuroe, was it? I need your help with something. I'm Nemu Hiragi. I'm a leader of the Magias, but I don't think we've met before. We haven't. Um, what is it you wanted? I made a rumor, and I was hoping you could go out and find it.

65
00:07:39,289 --> 00:07:43,289
Sorry, you... you said you made a rumor?

66
00:07:43,289 --> 00:07:58,289
Yes. I made all the rumors in Pamehama City. Unfortunately, I used too much of my power making them. It took its toll and then some. I'm going to die soon as a result.

67
00:07:58,289 --> 00:08:05,289
But never mind that. What I need is for you to go and find the rumor of the Eternal Sakura.

68
00:08:05,289 --> 00:08:07,289
Rumor of the Eternal Sakura?

69
00:08:07,289 --> 00:08:16,289
Yes. There's a special someone I want you to protect. I've written all the details down for you.

70
00:08:16,289 --> 00:08:21,289
Wait! Are you sure? I don't know if I can handle this!

71
00:08:21,289 --> 00:08:26,289
If I was well enough to do it myself, I would.

72
00:08:26,289 --> 00:08:33,289
One more thing. Please keep this between you and me. It's very important you don't tell anyone.

73
00:08:33,289 --> 00:08:43,289
If that's what you want. I mean it. Not even a member of the Magias. You can't tell anyone, no matter what.

74
00:08:43,289 --> 00:08:56,289
Okay, I won't.

75
00:08:56,289 --> 00:09:02,289
At this rate, I'm never gonna find it. This sucks. I should've said no to her.

76
00:09:02,289 --> 00:09:09,289
It's that little teeny cubee.

77
00:09:17,289 --> 00:09:19,289
Come back!

78
00:09:27,289 --> 00:09:29,289
At last, I'm home.

79
00:09:29,289 --> 00:09:33,289
What a day! I'm gonna kick back and veg out.

80
00:09:39,289 --> 00:09:40,289
What the?

81
00:09:40,289 --> 00:09:44,289
I let myself in, Mitama. I hope I didn't startle you too much.

82
00:09:44,289 --> 00:09:47,289
Not at all. It's great to see you again.

83
00:09:47,289 --> 00:09:52,289
You've been gone for quite a while. I started to think your shop was closed for good.

84
00:09:52,289 --> 00:09:57,289
No, the shop's doing fine. I just had to take a little business trip is all.

85
00:09:57,289 --> 00:10:00,289
That's just what I wanted to talk about.

86
00:10:02,289 --> 00:10:04,289
Did you go see the Magias?

87
00:10:04,289 --> 00:10:09,289
I met a girl who said she created the Doppels.

88
00:10:09,289 --> 00:10:13,289
Yes, that girl would be Toka.

89
00:10:13,289 --> 00:10:18,289
You lied. You didn't tell us you were adjusting our soul gems to help make Doppels for her cult.

90
00:10:18,289 --> 00:10:25,289
Technically, I wasn't lying. I just left that little detail out is all.

91
00:10:25,289 --> 00:10:33,289
In the end, I don't know what her ultimate goal is. I just put everyone's soul gems in alignment to help keep their Doppels in check.

92
00:10:33,289 --> 00:10:38,289
You always said that even knowing about Doppels and their power was dangerous.

93
00:10:38,289 --> 00:10:45,289
But the Magias say Doppels can be used somehow to free magical girls from their fate. Can they?

94
00:10:45,289 --> 00:10:51,289
Officially, they're called Doppel Witches. They're a reflection of emotions.

95
00:10:51,289 --> 00:11:00,289
When a soul gem gets so tainted, it becomes totally cloudy. The curse manifests in a section of the body.

96
00:11:00,289 --> 00:11:04,289
It's the power of the witch, and it's what you use to make a Doppel.

97
00:11:04,289 --> 00:11:09,289
When a Doppel Witch is summoned, the taint is removed from the soul gem during the transformation.

98
00:11:09,289 --> 00:11:19,289
As a result, your gem gets purified without having to use a grief seed. This process makes it possible to avoid turning into a witch.

99
00:11:19,289 --> 00:11:25,289
Sounds great if that's all you know about it, but Doppels are super addictive and they have bad side effects.

100
00:11:25,289 --> 00:11:30,289
Their existence is connected with the truth about how magical girls become witches.

101
00:11:30,289 --> 00:11:34,289
That's why I've always said it's dangerous to spread knowledge about them.

102
00:11:34,289 --> 00:11:37,289
And yet, the Magias don't think so.

103
00:11:37,289 --> 00:11:44,289
Well, maybe they think that compared to the risks, it's better than becoming a witch.

104
00:11:44,289 --> 00:11:49,289
I don't have an opinion either way.

105
00:11:49,289 --> 00:11:53,289
In my dealings with them, I've always tried to keep myself neutral.

106
00:11:53,289 --> 00:11:59,289
I need to find their base. Do you know where Hotel Fent Hope is?

107
00:11:59,289 --> 00:12:06,289
Like I said, I'm neutral and I'm staying that way. They're just trying to save magical girls. That's not such a bad thing, is it?

108
00:12:06,289 --> 00:12:13,289
They've also killed magical girls. They must be stopped.

109
00:12:13,289 --> 00:12:39,289
Now that Iroh has gone, I should feel pain, but I don't. I feel nothing. Just like before, when all my friends vanished. They were gone and life went on for me as usual. It was my fault it happened. I shouldn't have let it happen. And I hate myself for it. I know.

110
00:12:39,289 --> 00:12:44,289
Where is their base?

111
00:12:44,289 --> 00:12:56,289
I really don't know. Every time I've gone, I always had to have an invitation. The location always changes. You have to be guided there by a member of Magias. Someone wearing their symbol.

112
00:12:56,289 --> 00:13:09,289
That's easy enough. That's easy enough. I'll just find a black feather and force them. I will destroy the Magias for what they're doing. Maybe then I'll find peace.

113
00:13:09,289 --> 00:13:14,289
I've run out of grief seeds. I'd like to buy some.

114
00:13:14,289 --> 00:13:16,289
That I can do.

115
00:13:16,289 --> 00:13:22,289
An Uasa is definitely around here.

116
00:13:22,289 --> 00:13:23,289
An Uasa is definitely around here.

117
00:13:30,289 --> 00:13:35,289
It's Cube! Why are you here?

118
00:13:35,289 --> 00:13:37,289
Geez. About time you stopped.

119
00:13:38,289 --> 00:13:40,289
Do I… know you?

120
00:13:43,289 --> 00:13:44,289
Magias.

121
00:13:44,289 --> 00:13:44,749
Yes.

122
00:13:47,189 --> 00:13:47,949
Stop!

123
00:13:48,549 --> 00:13:50,569
Why is that small Kyuubei with her?

124
00:14:00,689 --> 00:14:01,569
That's it.

125
00:14:02,329 --> 00:14:04,789
I saw you with Iroha in that Kyuubei.

126
00:14:05,449 --> 00:14:07,509
You're the magical girl from Takarazaki.

127
00:14:08,369 --> 00:14:10,569
I have some questions for you.

128
00:14:10,569 --> 00:14:14,409
Go easy on her, Yachan.

129
00:14:14,929 --> 00:14:18,509
If you come at her looking all scary, she's not going to talk to you.

130
00:14:21,029 --> 00:14:21,429
Mifuyu!

131
00:14:21,829 --> 00:14:24,029
It's good to see you again, Yachan.

132
00:14:24,449 --> 00:14:27,149
How dare you show your face to me? Are you insane?

133
00:14:27,449 --> 00:14:30,489
I didn't come here to pick a fight with you. I just want to talk.

134
00:14:30,809 --> 00:14:32,149
I have nothing to say!

135
00:14:32,709 --> 00:14:35,869
Look, I know the Magias can be a little rough sometimes.

136
00:14:35,869 --> 00:14:40,509
But whatever sacrifices are made, we're just trying to save magical girls.

137
00:14:40,949 --> 00:14:41,549
Don't lie!

138
00:14:41,989 --> 00:14:43,689
